# CPU Scheduling

## Use Case
### Social Media CPU Scheduling

This project demonstrates CPU scheduling algorithms by modeling
how tasks generated by a social media platform can be scheduled
for CPU execution.

## Programs

### 1. FCFS
First Come, First Served schedules processes in the order they arrive.

### 2. SJF
Shortest Job First schedules the process with the smallest burst time first.

## Concepts Used

- CPU Scheduling
- Process Scheduling
- FCFS
- SJF
- Burst Time
- Waiting Time
- Turnaround Time
